#
# Example of job definition:
# .---------------- minute (0 - 59)
# |    .------------- hour (0 - 23)
# |    |      .---------- day of month (1 - 31)
# |    |      |     .------- month (1 - 12) OR jan,feb,mar,apr ...
# |    |      |     |     .---- day of week (0 - 6) (Sunday=0 or 7) OR sun,mon,tue,wed,thu,fri,sat
# |    |      |     |     |
# *    *      *     *     *     command to be executed
#

# encalertd 自身看门狗兜底（6001 watchdog_missing 消费方在 encalertd 内）：
# 每分钟检查 encalertd 存活；死亡时注入事件文件并拉起，
# encalertd 启动后消费事件 → 6001 报警（断网时落 spool 补发）
* * * * * pidof encalertd >/dev/null 2>&1 || { echo "watchdog_missing|\$(date +%s)" > /tmp/encalertd_event; /usr/bin/encalertd -c /etc/encalertd.conf -b; }
